{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1071380-chosen-of-the-ripple-a-jojo-s-bizarre-adventure-game-for-chronicles-of-darkness","id":1071380,"title":"Chosen of the Ripple: A Jojo's Bizarre Adventure game for Chronicles of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-31T12:50:13-07:00","id":1071380,"title":"Chosen of the Ripple: A Jojo's Bizarre Adventure game for Chronicles of Darkness","content":"Hello everyone. A few months ago I finished this project of mine and meant to share it. Though other places have seen this, I overlooked an obvious place to post this work: Here!<br /> <br /> So, for your enjoyment, I present to you <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HoCgoLAnK2blvtrin4hFRK32LF2l4VbSZtnA6UxU84w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chosen of the Ripple, a Jojo's Bizarre Adventure game for Chronicles of Darkness</b></a><br /> <br /> With this supplement you will be able to run games where your players are practitioners of one of the many Traditions of <b>Hamon</b>, a Martial Art that teaches mastery of the body and strikes with the raw power of the Sun, as well as the enigmatic <b>Stand Users</b>, strong willed beings obsessed with some goal or practice so much that their drive has been made manifest in supernatural power.<br /> <br /> This game is meant to be compatible with all other Chronicles of Darkness lines if you feel Bizarre enough to merge those two worlds, and enough fluff and crunch to work from has been given that a good ST can fill in the rest for themselves.<br /> <br /> Commenting is enabled on all pages, and encouraged.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HoCgoLAnK2blvtrin4hFRK32LF2l4VbSZtnA6UxU84w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Chosen of the Ripple: A Jojo's Bizarre Adventure game for Chronicles of Darkness</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6916-gentlemenshadow","name":"gentlemenshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6916_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T14:48:59-07:00","id":1071427,"title":"","content":"are the Vampires Kindred vampires?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-31T16:19:55-07:00","id":1071481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1071380-chosen-of-the-ripple-a-jojo-s-bizarre-adventure-game-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1071427#post1071427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"mess