w","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6916_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-29T21:59:48-07:00","id":1085695,"title":"","content":"In the case of intelligent and autonomous Stands, I think they could be represented as full Horrors that share the Twilight Entity Dread Power.<br /> <br /> Can Mages affect Stands with the Mind and Spirit Arcana? How about Werewolves and their Gifts? Can a Demon make Pacts with a Stand? Do Stand Users count as Kin for Beasts?<br /> <br /> Do Stand Users gain any protection against Possession by ephemereal beings and such?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-30T09:49:30-07:00","id":1085812,"title":"","content":"Darn, and here I was having ideas on the backburner for some mashup of Jojo and Persona for a fangame in the WoD and I've been beaten to the punch. XD<br /> <br /> This looks pretty cool, good job. :3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-01T17:48:29-07:00","id":1086398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1071380-chosen-of-the-ripple-a-jojo-s-bizarre-adventure-game-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1085695#post1085695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the case of intelligent and autonomous Stands, I think they could be represented as full Horrors that share the Twilight Entity Dread Power.<br /> <br /> Can Mages affect Stands with the Mind and Spirit Arcana? How about Werewolves and their Gifts? Can a Demon make Pacts with a Stand? Do Stand Users count as Kin for Beasts?<br /> <br /> Do Stand Users gain any protection against Possession by ephemereal beings and such?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Stand Users are able to be effected with the Spirit Arcana and Mind Arcana, depending on how they manifest, or if they manifest. Werewolves can effect Stands with any gift that would effect spirits. Demons can not make pacts with Stands unless it is a Stand independent of its user and is intelligent. Stand Users and Hamon Initiates do not count as Beasts, since they are fundamentally human and with human souls.<br /> <br /> Stands offer protection against possession the same way any splat does: adding their Potential as a Resistance","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HoCgoLAnK2blvtrin4hFRK32LF2l4VbSZtnA6UxU84w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Chosen of the Ripple: A Jojo's Bizarre Adventure game for Chronicles of Darkness</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6916-gentlemenshadow","name":"gentlemenshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6916_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-02T06:41:12-07:00","id":1086589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gentlemenshadow</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1071380-chosen-of-the-ripple-a-jojo-s-bizarre-adventure-game-for-chronicles-of-darkness?p=1072853#post1072853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That is total Vicissitude</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Is there an equivalent to that in Requiem?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","